WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
I mean no harm

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,000
I am a member of the One Ability Base

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,800
I just want to know about the situation in the new base

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,200
Understand the situation and need to circumvent the wall

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,600
No one answered the door outside

6
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,400
I can discuss cooperation on behalf of the base

7
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,800
Can also provide protection and material channels

8
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:18,090
Can I meet your person in charge?

9
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:19,490
All conditions can be negotiated

10
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:21,120
The leader is not seeing visitors now

11
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,320
Please leave the way you came.

12
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,320
i can wait

13
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:26,280
The next one won't fall to the ground

14
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,240
OK I go

15
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,840
At least tell your leader

16
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,440
The base is not here to capture strongholds.

17
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:39,340
Not even attacking with such force
